Package: helloworld
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-click
Description: tiny click hello-world CLI
 helloworld is a minimal command-line program built with Click that
 prints a friendly greeting. It serves as a reference template for
 packaging Python CLIs as native Debian packages with pybuild and
 dh-python.
